# Normalize every text file to LF, in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# This repository commits a generated artifact (lib/client.js) and CI asserts it
# matches a fresh build with `git diff --exit-code`. Byte-stability across
# platforms is what makes that check mean anything, and Git's core.autocrlf
# default on Windows would otherwise rewrite line endings on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be text-converted.
*.mp3 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
